### Listar empresas com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/company?registers=10&page=1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter todas as empresas
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/company/all
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter empresa por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/company/cd80ec7594c6ed430d17fb
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter empresa por documento
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/company/document/29.476.788/0001-99
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Criar empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/company
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Empresa de teste",
  "document": "{{companyDocument}}"
}

### Atualizar empresa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/company
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{idCompany}}",
  "name": "Empresa de teste atualizada"
}

### Excluir empresa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/company/{{idCompany}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}
